WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:13.560
The seventh day is over. You have now three more days left to work, but to work

00:13.560 --> 00:27.120
seriously you have only two more days left, because tenth day after the

00:27.120 --> 00:37.840
sitting from 8 to 9 you will learn a new technique of meditation and after that

00:37.840 --> 00:46.400
the vow of silence is over. Noble silence, no more noble silence, it will be noble

00:46.400 --> 00:56.840
chattering then. Chattering is chattering, noble or not noble. Chattering and

00:56.840 --> 01:01.640
serious meditation cannot co-exist.

